⚠️ 4. Failure Case
The system may misclassify homeless encampments with trash as purely environmental issues.
This can result in incorrect routing and inappropriate response from city departments.
⚖️ 5. Ethical Consideration
While AI improves efficiency and accessibility, it can misclassify complex social issues.
Human oversight is necessary to handle edge cases and ensure fair and responsible deployment.
